web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/out/
web/public/wasm-pkg/
web/public/wasm-pkg-threads/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
# Scraped maps: the browser fetches the committed `.gz` (inflated in-page via
# DecompressionStream), so the uncompressed `.json` is dead weight in git (Columbus alone is
# 32 MB) and in the static export. It's regenerable — `gunzip -k web/public/<map>.json.gz` —
# and only feeds the native map tests, which skip gracefully when it's absent (add that
# gunzip before `cargo test` in CI to run them). Track the `.gz`, ignore the `.json`.
web/public/*.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Golden-image regression writes this only on a mismatch, for inspection.
*.actual.png
